# variation 1 of b12: the list of the aspect is new in every call, in a loop
** spec: semantics/aspects.md#what-an-aspect-is
primary aspect b12_test1 is
  process main is
    for who in ("Ann", "Bob", "Cy") do
      apply names(who);
    done;
  return;
end b12_test1;
/*@expect
{
  "stdout": [
    "1: Ann",
    "1: Bob",
    "1: Cy"
  ]
}
*/
